title: With the diff on: editing a changed file turns its card back into plain text (and the diff comes back, with the typed line, after Escape), find walks matches inside a diffed card, a symbol is selected and gone to; nothing typed is lost and the save writes exactly the typed line
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/src/steps.rs :: ^fn step_1\(\) -> u32 \{\n// typed with the diff on\n    1\n\}[\s\S]*let two = 2;\n    two\n[\s\S]*step_5\(\) -> u32 \{\n    5\n\}\n\nfn step_7[\s\S]*eleven\(\)\n\}\n[\s\S]*fn step_14\(\) -> u32 \{\n    14\n\}\n$
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1000
zoom 0.5
diff on
wait 1500
mark 1-diff
wait 500
edit src/steps.rs 2 1
wait 1000
mark 2-editing-plain
wait 500
type // typed with the diff on
key enter
wait 1000
mark 3-typed
wait 500
key escape
wait 1500
mark 4-left-editor-unsaved
wait 500
tool edit
goto src/steps.rs
wait 800
find eleven
wait 1000
mark 5-find
wait 500
find next
wait 800
find close
wait 500
select step_7
wait 1200
mark 6-select
wait 500
key save
wait 1500
mark 7-saved
wait 500
diff off
wait 1200
mark 8-off
wait 500
quit
wait 1000
answer Close without saving
wait 800
